<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Linens 'n Things started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Linens 'n Things started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Amy Ryan has started coverage of Linens 'n Things Inc with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Clifton, N.J., home furnishings retailer closed at 22-7/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
